[[File:Snowdrake Updated.png|thumb|233x233px|Post Alpha 2.7]]
Snowdrake has changed a little bit. It started out with 3/3 for 4G to give +2 ATK to an ally monster.

'''Alpha 2.7''' nerfed it by lowering its HP to 2. This gave us a 3/2 monster for a long time, until '''Beta 6.0''' buffed its ATK to 4. '''Beta 10.2''' increased its HP back up to 3.
